name conv-xkv
category Package
revision 43558
shortdesc Create new key-value syntax
relocated 1
longdesc This small package supports key-value syntax other than the
longdesc standard LaTeX syntax of <key>=<value>. Using this package,
longdesc create key-values of the form <key>:<value> or <key>-><value>,
longdesc for example. The package converts the new notation to xkeyval
longdesc notation and passes it on to xkeyval.
runfiles size=2
